      "created_at": "2016-05-20T17:19:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So last night I was playing Kaargra Warfang in the Time Cataclysm. Things were going okay, until Surprise Shopping Trip came out.</p><p>When Tachyon had Chaos Lord</p><p>And Orrim Hiveminded had The Mindbreaker (and I, therefore, had avoided hitting him because I was low on HP to start with)</p><p>So the game ended in an unbreakable loop of Kaargra plays a card ==&gt; SST does 1 damage to everyone ==&gt; Orrim Hiveminded hits everyone ==&gt; Tachyon is hit and plays a card ==&gt; SST hits everyone ==&gt; OH hits everyone</p><p>Etc. until my whole team was dead.</p><p>Just... <em>damn</em>. Every once in a while, this game really finds a way to find me in the Alps.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
